# Run 2026-11-01, priority boot 3: reruns of the p1 BATCH-FAULT rows (perf/runs/r1101/judged_p1.md) on the r11p1
# superflat world. The GT-31 toml is set BEFORE this boot (bootexpect).
pace 1

## SQ-R11C-BOOT | boot, bot joins
bootexpect Done \(
> pbot spawn qa 0 -60 0
> time set midnight

## SQ-GT-31b | felsic helmet reach mB override read at boot
bootreject \[NCH.cfg\] no CEConfig.CRAFTING.FELSIC_
bootexpect CRAFTING.FELSIC_HELMET.reachMb overridden: default 500 -> 100
> zq rdetail felsic_helmet
look one 100 mB Long Reach fill and one 500 mB Magic Resistance fill

## SQ-PRI-01b | pizza topping tag, bell peppers, dishes
> zq itemtag brewinandchewin:foods/pizza_topping
> zq tagsof rusticdelight:bell_pepper_green
> zq makes brewinandchewin:pizza
> zq makes supreme_pizza
> zq makes ham_and_cheese_sandwich
> zq makes scarlet_pierogi
> zq tagsof brewinandchewin:kimchi
look bell peppers in the pizza topping tag; kimchi in the cooked soup-veggie tag; the dishes have recipes

## SQ-WCT-03b | Just a Well, two halves
> setblock -36 -60 -15 well:well
> setblock -36 -59 -15 well:well[half=upper]
sleep 20
> tp qa -36 -60 -13
> item replace entity qa weapon.mainhand with hearthandharvest:iron_watering_can
> data get block -36 -60 -15
> pbot use qa -36 -59 -15 north
> data get block -36 -60 -15
> data get entity qa SelectedItem
look WaterLevel 12 after the roof-half use; tank down 1000 mB; an empty well tank = setup (no water source), record

