> zq uses hearthandharvest:golden_watering_can
expect diamond_watering_can

## SQ-WC-05b | mulch soaked by the golden can
> gamerule randomTickSpeed 0
> fill -32 -61 -21 -30 -61 -19 immersive_weathering:mulch_block[moisture=0]
> fill -32 -60 -21 -30 -60 -19 minecraft:wheat[age=0]
> item replace entity qa weapon.mainhand with hearthandharvest:golden_watering_can{WaterLevel:16}
> tp qa -31 -60 -23
> pbot use qa -31 -60 -20 up
> fill -32 -61 -21 -30 -61 -19 minecraft:stone replace immersive_weathering:mulch_block[moisture=7]
> gamerule randomTickSpeed 3
expect Successfully filled 9 block

## SQ-HR-04b | raspberry tags; fox at night
> zq tagsof hearthandharvest:raspberry
expect forge:fruits/raspberries
expect forge:berries
expect minecraft:fox_food
> kill @e[type=fox]
> setblock 28 -60 -10 hearthandharvest:raspberry_bush[age=3]
> summon fox 27 -60 -10
sleep 60
> execute if block 28 -60 -10 hearthandharvest:raspberry_bush[age=1]
> execute as @e[type=fox] run data get entity @s HandItems
look fox empties the bush (age 1) and holds hearthandharvest:raspberry

## SQ-DM-03c | dandelions: fertile (mulch) vs rich soil
> gamerule randomTickSpeed 0
> fill 20 -61 30 29 -61 30 farmersdelight:rich_soil
> fill 20 -61 32 29 -61 32 immersive_weathering:mulch_block
> fill 20 -60 30 29 -60 30 minecraft:dandelion
> fill 20 -60 32 29 -60 32 minecraft:dandelion
> gamerule randomTickSpeed 30
sleep 30
> zq count 20 -60 30 29 -60 30 veggiesdelight:mature_dandelion
> zq count 20 -60 32 29 -60 32 veggiesdelight:mature_dandelion
sleep 30
> zq count 20 -60 30 29 -60 30 veggiesdelight:mature_dandelion
> zq count 20 -60 32 29 -60 32 veggiesdelight:mature_dandelion
> gamerule randomTickSpeed 3
look mulch row (z 32) about twice the rich row (z 30) at each read

